# Synthetic cycle-stamped recording for a2mcp's --key-file= replay tests
# (tests/run-tests.sh's "replay" block). Types "PRINT 2+2\r" -- 10 keys --
# spaced 60000 cycles apart, starting well past the ROM's boot sequence
# (KEYIN is reached around cycle 141500) so every key lands at the BASIC
# prompt rather than being swallowed by boot. At 17050 cycles/frame the last
# key (stamp 640000) is due by frame 38, so a 20+20 frame run splits the
# recording into two unequal halves for the status-progress check.
100000 80
160000 82
220000 73
280000 78
340000 84
400000 32
460000 50
520000 43
580000 50
640000 13
